# The vendored files `tests/_data/README.md` names are held to a git blob
# SHA-1 over their committed bytes, which `check_vendored_vectors.py` and
# its test read straight off the disk. `-text` is what keeps a checkout
# with `core.autocrlf=true` (Git for Windows' default) from converting
# them, so those bytes are the ones on disk on every platform.
tests/_data/core_musig_sortedmulti_a.json -text
tests/_data/descriptor_checksums.json -text
tests/_data/miniscript_fixed_tests.json -text
tests/_data/preimage_descriptors.json -text
tests/bip32/_data/bip32_invalid_keys.json -text
tests/bip32/_data/bip32_test_vectors.json -text
